        "summary": "Overall antiferromagnetic behavior: χMT at 300 K is 44.06 cm3 K mol−1 (calc. 43.50), nearly constant to 50 K then falling to 22.72 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K. Curie–Weiss: C = 40.89 cm3 K mol−1, θ = −1.22 K. Magnetization 33.94 NμB at 2.0 K / 7.0 T (calc. 44.00). −ΔSm = 13.86 J kg−1 K−1 at 3.5 K and 7 T (theoretical 33.07 J kg−1 K−1). Weak ferromagnetic GdIII···MnIII and MnIII···MnIII couplings via [M–O–N–M] are smaller than antiferromagnetic GdIII···GdIII and O-bridged GdIII···MnIII couplings. Demonstrated magnetocaloric effect.",
